        {"zh": "嗡嗡嗡，准备战斗！", "en": "Buzz, buzz, buzz, prepare for battle!"},
        {"zh": "翅膀嗡嗡，绕着蜂巢巡逻。", "en": "Wings buzzing, I circle the hive on patrol."},
